From 398ae7728c17284b1315db13116d0b87ec87ebdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:28:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 071/101] MAS local: refine the lean window navigation layout

Keep the lean toolbar as a hidden controller, build a fixed 54px navigation column in the right viewport margin, and preserve the native system-menu title bar flags across frame masking. Account for the column in guest sizing, zooming, geometry, and multi-display placement while keeping safe-shutdown feedback and modal parents on the container.

